# S-850 / B-338: TypeAssert pattern pipeline is fully elaborated end-to-end.
# [@Int x] arm is now converted from TypeAssertPending to TypeAssert by lower.rs
# using the TypeAnnotationTable populated by the type checker (B-338 fix).
# Pattern::TypeAssert arm in eval.rs is the primary runtime path.
# The bound variable x is usable as an Int in the arm body.
[match 42
  [@Int x]: [+ x 1]
  _: 0]
=== out
Int(43)
